{
  "name": "Prospect Outreach - 20 emails every 4 hours",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Prospect outreach drip\nSends **1 email every 12 minutes, around the clock = 20 emails every 4 hours** (120/day).\n\nTo change the pace, edit the trigger's cron: `0 */12 * * * *`. Limit hours with e.g. `0 */12 8-19 * * *`.\n\n1. Upload `Trading_Bot_and_Business_Dashboard_Prospects.xlsx` to Google Drive and open it as a Google Sheet (tab name: `Prospects`).\n2. Paste the sheet URL into **Read Prospects**, **Mark as Sent** and **Mark as Failed**.\n3. Connect your Google Sheets + Gmail credentials.\n4. Set the workflow timezone (Settings) to yours.\n5. Replace YOUR NAME / yourwebsite.com in **Send Email (Gmail)**.\n6. Test with **Execute workflow**, then Publish / Activate.\n\nOnly rows with an **Email** and an empty **Status** are sent. Each sent row gets `Status = Sent <date>` so nobody is emailed twice. Failed sends get `Failed <date>`.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "f82ef80b-4a46-48ea-b588-92306557f991",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 */12 * * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "8fa37ecf-411d-4d2f-880a-4d4097a021ed",
      "name": "Every 12 min (20 per 4 hours)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "PASTE_YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL_HERE",
          "mode": "url"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Prospects",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "97e3ffc8-64d4-4e01-b877-5c7c697e4dcd",
      "name": "Read Prospects",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "e26bd5df-9f01-44a5-8d2c-942bbac2dc40",
              "leftValue": "={{ String($json.Email ?? '').trim() }}",
              "rightValue": "@",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "contains"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "400ab42e-ea08-4d2b-a728-ab2d5dd92b6b",
              "leftValue": "={{ String($json.Status ?? '').trim() }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "empty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "46739018-9f5d-4ab1-b0e4-e4587747dc98",
      "name": "Has Email & Not Yet Sent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
